# Live camera: VisionCamera vs Expo

## Current architecture

- Prefer **VisionCamera v5** (`photoOutput.capturePhoto`) when `isVisionCameraLinked()` (Nitro `CameraFactory` present).
- Fall back to Expo `CameraView.takePictureAsync` on older binaries (OTA cannot add VisionCamera).
- Gate import via `LiveVisionCameraGate` so unlinked builds never evaluate `react-native-vision-camera`.

## Native rebuild required

VisionCamera needs a new EAS binary. OTA alone is not enough.

## What NOT to do

- Do not probe readiness with Expo `takePictureAsync` on Start Live
- Do not `require('react-native-vision-camera')` to feature-detect (import creates HybridObjects)
- Do not restart the sample loop from `useEffect([isLive, processFrame])`
